### Quick Start Script

If you’re ready to spin up a skeleton right now:

```bash
npx degit sveltejs/template ecommerce-frontend
cd ecommerce-frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Replace the template with React/Vue/Angular as per your preference.

---

That’s the high‑level blueprint. From here, iterate on each piece, involve designers early, keep the codebase modular, and always ship small, incremental changes. Happy coding!
